# Candidate PNCS Hybrid Memory Grammar v0.3 source.
# Source authority: PNCS_HYBRID_MEMORY_GRAMMAR_V0_3.
# Structural declaration only; compute operators require existing admission.
PROGRAM memory_state_space
TASK transition
INPUT active_state : STATE
INPUT relation_graph : GRAPH
INPUT observed_transition : JSON
INPUT context : JSON

MEMORY trace_history RETAINS STATE RELATION PATH PERSISTENCE PERSISTENT ACCESS DIRECT PLASTICITY APPEND_ONLY EFFECT CONSTRAINT EPISTEMIC HYPOTHESIS
MEMORY learned_geometry RETAINS RELATION PATH TOPOLOGY OPERATOR BOUNDARY PERSISTENCE STRUCTURAL ACCESS IMPLICIT RECONSTRUCTIVE PLASTICITY ADAPTIVE CONSOLIDATING EFFECT ROUTING CONSTRAINT EPISTEMIC HYPOTHESIS

COMPUTE admitted_transition : JSON USING verified_transition INPUT observed_transition context MODE AUTO
REQUIRE verified_source ON compute.admitted_transition
COMPUTE next_route : JSON USING relation_route_selection INPUT active_state relation_graph context MODE AUTO

EVENT transition_event FROM admitted_transition
LAW geometry_update FOR learned_geometry USING path_reinforcement
TRACE transition_trace FROM transition_event INTO trace_history
ROUTE transition_route : compute.admitted_transition compute.next_route
GUIDE compute.next_route USING learned_geometry
COUPLE trace_history TO learned_geometry MODE CONSOLIDATE TIMESCALE slow

RETURN next_route
